OL,3,GNEWSASwimmer dies after getting into
OL,4,Adifficulty in sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after getting into
OL,7,Fdifficulty while swimming in the sea,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FBlackpool Sands in Strete at about
OL,12,F15:30 BST on Monday, said Devon and
OL,13,FCornwall Police.
OL,15,FThe force said a man in his 40s from
OL,16,FSurrey was pulled from the water and
OL,17,Ftreated by paramedics but was
OL,18,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,20,FHis death is not being treated as
OL,21,Fsuspicious, said police.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
